### DBGL API Tests
### Base URL: https://sandbox.dbgl.ng
### Auth headers: X-Api-Key and X-Api-Secret

@baseUrl = https://sandbox.dbgl.ng
@apiKey =
@apiSecret =
@partnerOrderRef = chopbaze_order_{{$guid}}


### 1) Register or update the webhook URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/apip/api/webhook_config.php
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Api-Secret: {{apiSecret}}

{
  "webhook_url": "https://your-domain.example.com/api/v1/delivery-orders/webhook",
  "regenerate_secret": false
}

###

### 2) Get current webhook configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/apip/api/webhook_config.php
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Api-Secret: {{apiSecret}}

###

### 3) Get a delivery quote (pre-checkout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/apip/api/orders_quote.php
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Api-Secret: {{apiSecret}}

{
  "vendor_city": "Lagos",
  "vendor_state": "Lagos",
  "vendor_address": "12 Adeola Odeku St, Victoria Island",
  "delivery_city": "Lekki",
  "delivery_state": "Lagos",
  "delivery_address": "5 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1",
  "service_type": "standard",
  "weight_kg": 2.5
}

###

### 4) Create a delivery order
POST {{baseUrl}}/apip/api/orders_create.php
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Api-Secret: {{apiSecret}}

{
  "partner_order_ref": "{{partnerOrderRef}}",
  "vendor_name": "Chopbaze Kitchen",
  "vendor_phone": "08011112222",
  "vendor_address": "12 Adeola Odeku St, Victoria Island",
  "vendor_city": "Lagos",
  "vendor_state": "Lagos",
  "pickup_latitude": 6.4281,
  "pickup_longitude": 3.4219,
  "customer_name": "Jane Customer",
  "customer_phone": "08033334444",
  "delivery_address": "5 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1",
  "delivery_city": "Lekki",
  "delivery_state": "Lagos",
  "delivery_latitude": 6.4492,
  "delivery_longitude": 3.4720,
  "package_description": "Food order delivery",
  "weight_kg": 2.5,
  "service_type": "standard"
}

###
@orderId = ORD146929652
@waybillNo = WB033764695

# {
#   "order_id": "ORD146929652",
#   "waybill_no": "WB033764695",
#   "status": "confirmed",
#   "total_amount": 3805,
#   "discount_percent": 0,
#   "discount_amount": 0,
#   "currency": "NGN",
#   "review_required": false,
#   "delivery_pin": "579986"
# }

### 5) Check order status by DBGL order id
GET {{baseUrl}}/apip/api/orders_status.php?order_id={{orderId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Api-Secret: {{apiSecret}}

###

### 6) Check order status by partner reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/apip/api/orders_status.php?partner_order_ref=chopbaze_order_90c49177-280e-4f00-82d6-9f08a3c770a6
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Api-Secret: {{apiSecret}}

###

### 7) Example DBGL webhook body (for verification testing)
# The real webhook should send X-Webhook-Signature: <hmac-sha256(raw-body, DBGL_WEBHOOK_SECRET)>
POST https://your-domain.example.com/api/v1/delivery-orders/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Signature: replace_with_hmac_sha256_hex

{
  "event": "order.confirmed",
  "order_id": "ORD293535848",
  "partner_order_ref": "MKT-00123",
  "status": "confirmed",
  "shipment_status": "pending_assignment",
  "delivery_pin": "384920",
  "total_amount": 3687,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "timestamp": "2026-08-22T14:03:11+01:00"
}

###

### 8) Local app endpoint equivalents
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/delivery-orders/quote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_here

{
  "vendor_city": "Lagos",
  "vendor_state": "Lagos",
  "vendor_address": "12 Adeola Odeku St, Victoria Island",
  "delivery_city": "Lekki",
  "delivery_state": "Lagos",
  "delivery_address": "5 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1",
  "service_type": "standard",
  "weight_kg": 2.5
}

###

